:"https://github.com/howardhuanghua","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-10-07T20:56:34Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/705931140","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/62920#issuecomment-705931140","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/62920","id":705931140,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcwNTkzMTE0MA==","user":{"login":"howardhuanghua","id":15325213,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzI1MjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15325213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua","html_url":"https://github.com/howardhuanghua","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-09T02:33:17Z","updated_at":"2020-10-09T02:34:18Z","body":"Hi @rjernst, we have tried deleting the archived settings in the same request as clearing the cluster block, it also would be blocked.\r\n\r\nHere is the current cluster settings:\r\n```\r\ncurl localhost:5100/es/test_archived/_cluster/settings?pretty\r\nResponse:\r\n{\r\n  \"persistent\" : {\r\n    \"archived\" : {\r\n      \"search\" : {\r\n        \"check_buckets_step_size\" : \"10000\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"cluster\" : {\r\n      \"blocks\" : {\r\n        \"read_only_allow_delete\" : \"true\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"transient\" : { }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nAnd I tried to set read only and archived setting together but also failed:\r\n```\r\ncurl -XPUT \"/_cluster/settings?pretty\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d' {\r\n   \"persistent\" : {\r\n     \"cluster.blocks.read_only_allow_delete\": false,\r\n     \"archived.search.check_buckets_step_size\": null\r\n   }\r\n }'\r\n\r\nResponse:\r\n{\r\n  \"error\" : {\r\n    \"root_cause\" : [\r\n      {\r\n        \"type\" : \"cluster_block_exception\",\r\n        \"reason\" : \"blocked by: [FORBIDDEN/13/cluster read-only / allow delete (api)];\"\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"type\" : \"cluster_block_exception\",\r\n    \"reason\" : \"blocked by: [FORBIDDEN/13/cluster read-only / allow delete (api)];\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"status\" : 403\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith our fix, we could set read only block to false and remove the archived setting:\r\n```\r\ncurl -XPUT \"/_cluster/settings?pretty\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d' {\r\n  \"persistent\" : {\r\n    \"cluster.blocks.read_only_allow_delete\": false\r\n  }                                          \r\n}'\r\n{\r\n  \"acknowledged\" : true,\r\n  \"persistent\" : {\r\n    \"cluster\" : {\r\n      \"blocks\" : {\r\n        \"read_only_allow_delete\" : \"false\"\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"transient\" : { }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl -XPUT \"/_cluster/settings\" -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -d' {\r\n  \"persistent\" : {\r\n    \"archived.*\": null\r\n  }\r\n}'\r\n{\"acknowledged\":true,\"persistent\":{},\"transient\":{}}\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/705931140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"howardhuanghua","id":15325213,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzI1MjEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15325213?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua","html_url":"https://github.com/howardhuanghua","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/howardhuanghua/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3858148020,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50Mzg1ODE0ODAyMA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/events/3858148020","actor":{"login":"rjernst","id":289412,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4OTQxMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.